{title: Kuch Toh Hai}
{artist: Armaan Malik Amaal Malik Do Lafzo Ki Kahani}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em] ... [D] ... [Am] ... [D],        [Em] ... [D] ... [Am] ... [D]
[Em]Aahatein kaisi yeh [D]aahatein,        Sunta hoon [Am]aaj kal, aye dil [D]bata
[Em]Dastakein dete hain [D]dastakein,        Kyun [Am]ajnabi se pal, aye dil [D]bata
[Em]Kuch toh hai jo [Am]neend aaye kam,        [D]Kuch toh hai jo [G]aankhe hain nam
[C]Kuch toh hai jo [Am]tu keh de toh,        [D]Hanste hanste [G]marr jaayein hum
[Em] ... [Am] ... [D] ... [G],        [C] ... [Am] ... [D] ... [G]
[Em]Mujhse zyada [C]mere jaisa,        [Am]Koi hai toh hai [D]tu
[Em]Phir na jaane [C]dil mera kyun,        [Am]Tujhko na de [D]sakoon
[Em]Kuch toh hai jo [Am]dil ghabraaye,        [D]Kuch toh hai jo [G]saans naa aaye
[C]Kuch toh hai jo [Am]hum honthon se,        [D]Kehte kehte [G]keh naa paayein
[Em] ... [Am] ... [D] ... [G],        [C] ... [Am] ... [D] ... [G]
[Em] ... [C] ... [Am] ... [D],        [Em] ... [C] ... [Am] ... [D]
[Em]Jo humare [C]darmiyaan hain,        [Am]Iss ko hum kya [D]kahein
[Em]Ishq kya hai [C]ik lehar hai,        [Am]Aao isme [D]bahein
[Em]Kuch toh hai jo [Am]hum hain khoye,        [D]Kuch toh hai jo [G]tum na soye
[C]Kuch toh hai jo [Am]hum dono yun,        [D]Hanste hanste [G]itna roye
[Em] ... [Am] ... [D] ... [G],        [C] ... [Am] ... [D] ... [G]
